-g MyResourceGroup -n MyVM --query \"storageProfile.osDisk.managedDisk.id\" -o tsv)\n\n# Create the snapshot\naz snapshot create -g MyResourceGroup -n MySnapshot --source \"$osdiskid\"\n```\n\n**2. Create an incremental snapshot**\nIncremental snapshots are efficient for backups of managed disks[6].\n```bash\naz snapshot create -g MyResourceGroup -n MySnapshot --source <disk-id> --incremental true\n```\n\n**3. Create a snapshot from a blob URI**\n```bash\naz snapshot create -g MyResourceGroup -n MySnapshot --source https://vhd1234.blob.core.windows.net/vhds/osdisk1234.vhd\n```\n\nFor more details and optional flags (such as `--sku`, `--location`, or `--incremental`), you can refer to the official [az snapshot documentation](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cli/azure/snapshot?view=azure-cli-latest) on Microsoft Learn[1].\n\nSources:\n[1] [microsoft.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFnrhVFw3L6RjpteETNJ2skhQgR13hz4eHlXmb6jIgepi1P7OWGkc6MznFlaSd3Hd9Mu5UC788NRg7jzeWcDI89aXSMvu4MKS5eg1Ai8-NkBstD88fJk0z5ZtsAXtNqPKkO5KfZSRTUBqnePrI3uD0xhkjE-_MytDmyC0fNpUW5iw==)\n[2] [microsoft.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH8pF6VDZlfSzOkZSP2AvVPwGvaHEUsrJg_slo8jDtnCU8OnPZeLeFzGiFD_SSOHGXtpcnTxlsdCsQi4Xjt-58O09clnSfB1Ed9fLc66mncOyUd1bhcc3t_qYcEYi-i381A6GtGZwMtP14P5XRl-vYwP393qM_gw8Qch3Pou-VMJUxRB169UBAbbw==)\n[3] [microsoft.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF6bUXltgB84z8_j7UARrScjrIefOrHKIsJeQo0zLUjdkmYSY7rENHU2D0hsjUuTgtBYmalx5QhTp0bJ0fOLGjgqoFg9ldQRKn8M_X6llyuMitrFQbTiFsFYyWZCsmLZq39C3NcQ5qljhSnDNT35qTmX19NSqoEb1zPa5VNo0NEPG__FZRiCzmWpd8=)\n[4] [microsoft.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGi1YDyFwNPdSRQF_pS0PLnw6DwLm7V1pon5gpPEyGal4j9JQXttqcmKr0lDLFR5Y9AbroRLS0xCzDMa7mGpfGfWl_kyNP9LWydQr8fIEYP6fWUhrMGToqtTgd22lfsrpHp5aV3T5tM_OC9eONIk8-YKUxZ92AXWhTYR0u_kfPzBWnF6dk6YjTHjIylIqDoauxejaCDzLoRMKCURkDO)\n[5] [microsoft.com](https://ve